  <h2>PCS Moving Checklist: San Antonio Edition</h2>

  <p>A military PCS move requires careful planning. Use this comprehensive checklist to ensure nothing falls through the cracks during your relocation to San Antonio.</p>

  <h3>Pre-Move Planning (60 Days Out)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Review PCS orders and move timeline</li>
    <li>Schedule home search consultation</li>
    <li>Get pre-approved for VA or other loans</li>
    <li>Research San Antonio schools and communities</li>
    <li>Connect with current residents for insights</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Home Search Phase (30-45 Days)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Tour properties with agent</li>
    <li>Request virtual tours if remote</li>
    <li>Research neighborhoods thoroughly</li>
    <li>Check school boundaries and ratings</li>
    <li>Make offer on desired property</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Closing Phase (15-30 Days)</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Complete home inspection</li>
    <li>Schedule appraisal</li>
    <li>Finalize mortgage details</li>
    <li>Coordinate title and closing</li>
    <li>Final walkthrough</li>
    <li>Close on your new home</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Post-Move Essentials</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Utility setup and transfers</li>
    <li>Address changes with military</li>
    <li>School registration</li>
    <li>Get to know your community</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Ready to Move?</h2>
  <p>I'll help coordinate your entire PCS move to make it smooth and stress-free.</p>
</BlogLayout>
